Z||000000||GT Bastard||01-26-2001||02:51 AM||||I used to have an '85 IROC Camaro(totally crapped-out) that I beat the hell out of... I was only 17.  I got that poor car airborn.  That car went through hell and back.  Neutral drops, powerbrakes, massive burnouts, and fish-tailing around every corner...  Then I got a pristine '84 Z28 H.O. and I treated that car like a queen.  The tranny blew while cruizing down the highway at 65 mhp and I sold it.  Went to the gas station tonight with Fierogod to get a coffee...  Decided to get beer instead(beer tastes like sh!t.)  Anyhow, to make a long story short, I'm drunk.  If I were any less anal about grammer, I wouldn't have spent way too long correcting my spelling.  We were cruizing in an Isuzu Rodeo and I say: "I don't want to go home yet."  This was implying that I felt like driving around. So he turns onto a street we've never been on before, and it just happens to go in a loop that leads back to almost the same spot.  It's a metaphor for life.  I could babble on endlessly but I may just quit while I'm ahead.  Or behind.... Nobody knows.||||reg||1
